        "created_at": "2025-03-18T00:24:26.316Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Respected team,</p>\n<p>I have a small clarification regarding the BPT assignment deadline. I noticed the deadline is listed as “(=18 march)”, which I interpreted to mean submissions were due by March 18th at 11:59 PM. Based on this understanding, I completed and am submitting my BPT4_problem_4 today. I had Quiz 2 on March 16th, and due to this commitment, I had to resort to a last-minute submission for the BPT assignment.</p>\n<p>However, if the actual deadline was March 17th at 11:59 PM, I would like to respectfully request a one-day extension for my submission. Kindly consider this request.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your understanding.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 2,
